{"id":"sprecher","lemma":"Sprecher","pos":"noun","rank":4477,"glosses":["one who speaks in a presentation or performance, such as a radio drama or voiceover","an announcer, newsreader","a spokesperson, representative"],"ipa":"/ˈʃprɛçər/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/0/03/De-Sprecher.ogg/De-Sprecher.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Sprechers","plural":"Sprecher","feminine":"Sprecherin"},"examples":[{"text":"Der Sprecher ist jung.","en":"The speaker is young.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"young"}]},{"text":"Er ist ein guter Sprecher.","en":"He is an excellent speaker.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"good","l":"gut"},null]},{"text":"Jedem Sprecher wurden fünf Minuten zugestanden.","en":"Each speaker was allotted five minutes.","words":[{"g":"each","l":"jeder"},null,{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"five (numerical value…"},{"g":"minute (unit of time","l":"Minute"},{"g":"to be entitled","l":"zustehen"}]},{"text":"Die Menge versammelte sich um den Sprecher.","en":"The crowd gathered around the speaker.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"quantity"},{"g":"to gather, to assemble","l":"versammeln"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"around / at"},{"g":"the","l":"der"},null]},{"text":"Der Sprecher bestätigte, dass der Bericht wahr sei.","en":"The spokesman confirmed that the report was true.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to confirm","l":"bestätigen"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"report"},{"g":"true, real"},{"g":"to be","l":"sein"}]}]}